{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994930/extras/8a5c258485bccc78dba4bb83d3f5e777.avif?t=1757769744\" width=868 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><strong>Flam'n'Stache</strong> is a 2D puzzle-action game where you play as <strong>Lord Mustache</strong>, a bold medieval hero armed with a magical grappling hook. Your mission: guide fireballs through trap-filled levels to a <strong>magical pillar</strong>, which unlocks the door to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But beware!</strong> You don\u2019t control the fireballs directly. Use your grappling hook to pivot poles, platforms, and other objects to redirect their path. Each level is a dynamic puzzle where precision and strategy are key. <br> <br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay:</strong> Combine thinking and action to solve puzzles by manipulating the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Medieval World:</strong> Beautiful 2D graphics inspired by chivalrous legends and mysterious dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Mechanics:</strong> Use your grappling hook to interact with objects, trigger levers, and avoid traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Levels:</strong> Each level offers a new challenge, with increasingly clever obstacles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994930/extras/40e6ea37925b06de08a1d3be512946e8.poster.avif?t=1757769744\" width=866 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994930/extras/40e6ea37925b06de08a1d3be512946e8.webm?t=1757769744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994930/extras/40e6ea37925b06de08a1d3be512946e8.mp4?t=1757769744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994930?t=1757769744","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994930/243d68528810d80b008c8e26121852a3fc4e663d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757769744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994930/b14b4fa1f9428d07e9d474d82504ff1cfd2556bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757769744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994930/b14b4fa1f9428d07e9d474d82504ff1cfd2556bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757769744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994930/extras/8a5c258485bccc78dba4bb83d3f5e777.avif?t=1757769744\" width=868 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><strong>Flam'n'Stache</strong> is a 2D puzzle-action game where you play as <strong>Lord Mustache</strong>, a bold medieval hero armed with a magical grappling hook. Your mission: guide fireballs through trap-filled levels to a <strong>magical pillar</strong>, which unlocks the door to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But beware!</strong> You don\u2019t control the fireballs directly. Use your grappling hook to pivot poles, platforms, and other objects to redirect their path. Each level is a dynamic puzzle where precision and strategy are key. <br> <br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph